      "title": "",
      "instruction": "Creativity Challenge during the Covid-19 pandemic: 3D museum of random items found around the house during isolation. I bought this diary at a little book store in Santorini (there were cats napping among the books and I loved every second of being there). It has mostly served as a travel journal, but sometimes I use it to document other significant moments. I haven't gotten around to writing about my experiences during this pandemic, but eventually I will so that I have something to look back on later. Until then, this 3D diary will serve. Source: Objaverse 1.0 / Sketchfab",
